# Line endings, normalised. This team is split across Windows and macOS, and without this file
# a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true checks out CRLF — at which point `prettier --check`
# fails locally while Linux CI passes, which is the worst possible split.
#
# `eol=lf` makes every checkout LF on every OS, matching Prettier's default and the .mjs
# tooling. Set once, here, rather than asking each developer to configure git correctly.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated, and huge. Collapse it in diffs and never merge it by hand — regenerate instead.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff

# Binaries: never touch the bytes, never try to diff them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.p8 binary
*.p12 binary
*.mobileprovision binary
